   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xF6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is a response of Serbia-Montenegro to the World Summit of Sustainable Development (SD) in Johannesburg 2002, where countries undertook to start implementation of SD by 2005. Sida support of 6.1 MSEK will aim at capacity building, including advisory services, participatory dialogues, study tours and workshops and strengthening the Republic Councils for SD. UNDP will implement and manage.</narrative>
